<title>venezuela: SOCCER-MINERVEN BEAT UNIVERSIDAD CATOLICA 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MINERVEN BEAT UNIVERSIDAD CATOLICA 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>PUERTO ORDAZ, Venezuela 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minerven</p>
<p>(Venezuela) beat Universidad Catolica (Chile) 1-0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>in a South American Libertadores Cup first round, group three</p>
<p>game on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Luis Tizamo 53</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p> Colo Colo			 4  3  1  0  6  2  10</p>
<p> Universidad Catolica	  6  2  2  2 15  6   8</p>
<p> Minerven			  5  2  1  2  2  7   7</p>
<p> Mineros			   5  0  2  3  1  9   2</p>
<p>(Colo Colo, Universidad Catolica and Minerven qualify for</p>
<p>the second round)</p>
</text>
